      "text": "Here are the search results with sources answering the question: **The capital of France is Paris, and the river that runs through it is the Seine River.**\n\n## Answer Summary\n- **Capital of France:** Paris\n- **River running through it:** The Seine River (flows ~8 miles/13 km through the center of the city)\n\n## Sources\n\n**Encyclopedias & Reference**\n\n1. **Seine River | Paris, France, History & Facts — Britannica**\n   https://www.britannica.com/place/Seine-River\n   *\"Paris, city and capital of France, situated in the north-central part of the country... located along the Seine River...\"*\n\n2. **Paris | Definition, Map, Population, Facts, & History — Britannica**\n   https://www.britannica.com/print/article/443621\n\n3. **Development of Paris and significant historical sites — Britannica**\n   https://www.britannica.com/summary/Paris\n   *\"Paris, City... river port, capital of France. It is now located on both banks of the Seine River.\"*\n\n4. **Seine River summary — Britannica**\n   https://www.britannica.com/summary/Seine-River\n\n5. **1911 Encyclopædia Britannica/Paris — Wikisource**\n   https://en.wikisource.org/wiki/1911_Encyclop%C3%A6dia_Britannica/Paris\n\n**Articles & Travel Sites**\n\n6. **Which River Runs Through Paris? — WorldAtlas**\n   https://www.worldatlas.com/articles/which-river-runs-through-paris.html\n   *\"Paris is the largest city and the capital city of France. Paris is on the River Seine...\"*\n\n7. **What is the Capital of France? Paris — Countryaah**\n   https://www.countryaah.com/france-faqs/\n   *\"Paris, the capital city of France... Located in the northern part of the country along the Seine River...\"*\n\n8. **What is the Capital of France? — Mappr**\n   https://www.mappr.co/capital-cities/france/\n\n9. **Paris — ReadLittle**\n   https://readlittle.com/en/article/paris\n   *\"Paris is the capital city of France. It is located in northern France, along the Seine River.\"*\n\n10. **Seine River — Encyclopedia of Earth**\n    https://editors.eol.org/eoearth/wiki/Seine_River_(Forests)\n    *\"It flows through the capital city of Paris.\"*\n\n11. **The Seine River flows through which European capital city? — Snippets**\n    https://snippets.com/the-seine-river-flows-through-which-european-capital-city.htm\n\n12. **Paris the capital of France is located on this river? — Answers**\n    https://www.answers.com/travel-destinations/Paris_the_capital_of_France_is_located_on_this_river\n\n**News & In-Depth Features**\n\n13. **How the Seine River shaped the city of Paris — National Geographic**\n    https://www.nationalgeographic.com/premium/article/seine-river-paris-history\n\n14. **As Anne Hidalgo swims in the Seine, an explainer on why it has so often been the 'River of France' — Down To Earth**\n    https://www.downtoearth.org.in/rivers/as-anne-hidalgo-swims-in-the-seine-an-explainer-on-why-it-has-so-often-been-the-river-of-france\n\n15. **Epinay-sur-Seine | History, Geography, & Points of Interest — Britannica**\n    https://www.britannica.com/place/Epinay-sur-Seine\n\n**Note:** Most sources consistently confirm that **Paris** is the capital of France and that the **Seine River** runs through it. Britannica is generally the most authoritative of these sources."
